<title>HUNGARY: Hungary Sept budget deficit drops to HUF 114.8 bln.</title>
<headline>Hungary Sept budget deficit drops to HUF 114.8 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary accumulated a central state budget deficit of 114.8 billion forints in the first three quarters of the year, down from 215.8 billion forints in the same period in 1995, the Finance Ministry said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>BUDGET (bln forints) Jan-Sept 96 Jan-Aug 96  Jan-Sept 95</p>
<p>    EXPENDITURES	     1,512.5	1,357.5    1,227.3</p>
<p>    REVENUES		   1,397.7	1,236.9    1,011.5</p>
<p>    BALANCE		     -114.8	 -120.6     -215.8</p>
<p>NOTE - The budget revenues do not include privatisation revenues.    -- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
</text>
